machine fork/mouth
  states
    unchosen
    chosen

  transition goLeft()
    unchosen -> chosen
    guard room/entry `cleared` mark/yes
    assert path/left `cleared` mark/yes
    assert self `state` chosen
    retract self `state`

  transition goRight()
    unchosen -> chosen
    guard room/entry `cleared` mark/yes
    assert path/right `cleared` mark/yes
    assert self `state` chosen
    retract self `state`

